# --- Rust <-> Unity build artefacts ---
# These are produced by crates/tools/build-{native,wasm}.ps1 and are gitignored
# so the binary is never the source of truth. Their .meta files ARE tracked,
# because Unity needs them to treat the folders correctly. A fresh clone must run
# the build scripts before Unity will find the plugin; see crates/war-core/PORT-NOTES.md.
Assets/Plugins/x86_64/*.dll
Assets/StreamingAssets/war_core/*.wasm

